@ Index:   Free-fall height residual for PGMSLV
@ Author:  Walter Bonin, fm org C47 test program
@ Created: original publication date unknown
@ Version: 0.29
@ Tested:  Solution time
@ Input:   Driven by FreFp2
@ Output:  Time taken = 5.070303019685519581163707165121980 s
@
@ Height residual in Earth's gravity, set to zero by the solver:
@ h0 + v0*time - g_⊕/2*time^2 - height.
@
@ Originally published as the function passed to PGMSLV under
@ "The Solver" section of the WP43 Owner's Manual.  See the
@ wrapper FreFp2.p47u for how to call this.
LBL ‘FreeFp’
  g_⊕
  -2
  ÷
  RCL× ‘time’
  RCL+ ‘v0’
  RCL× ‘time’
  RCL+ ‘h0’
  RCL- ‘height’     ; residual of the height equation
  RTN
  END
.END.
